{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Succeed or Fade: Our fate-gambling flip is about to begin.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;You too can become a star&quot;\u2014lured by these sweet words, you stepped onto an isolated island in a distant sea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > However, what awaited you was not a dazzling stage, but a brutal &quot;Streaming Contract&quot; with your survival on the line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is simple: endlessly flip bottles, stream to the world, and keep earning. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success or eternal oblivion?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A streaming survival game where you bet your destiny begins now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761310/extras/10e54b4f5205994a8e84768c700824ec.poster.avif?t=1765957802\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761310/extras/10e54b4f5205994a8e84768c700824ec.webm?t=1765957802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761310/extras/10e54b4f5205994a8e84768c700824ec.mp4?t=1765957802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong></strong><br><br><br><br><strong>Game Rules</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Harsh Streamer Life</strong><br>Your bottle-flipping stream runs from 4:00 AM to 11:00 PM in-game time. <br>Land a mesmerizing flip, and your viewer count will soar. Fail repeatedly, and they will leave. At the end of the day, you'll receive dividends based on your performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761310/extras/6a9797b80cfb1463fba80435e4a3dcd0.poster.avif?t=1765957802\" width=1100 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761310/extras/6a9797b80cfb1463fba80435e4a3dcd0.webm?t=1765957802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761310/extras/6a9797b80cfb1463fba80435e4a3dcd0.mp4?t=1765957802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Payment of the Contract Fee</strong><br> To continue streaming, you must pay a hefty streaming contract fee on the nights of Day 3, Day 6, and Day 10.<br> Failure to pay means immediate &quot;Elimination.&quot; In multiplayer, you can cover a teammate's fees if their earnings are low, but if someone keeps dragging the team down, you risk mutual destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761310/extras/6d3c78e557cb6fdb7545ba1897a7fce6.poster.avif?t=1765957802\" width=1100 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761310/extras/6d3c78e557cb6fdb7545ba1897a7fce6.webm?t=1765957802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761310/extras/6d3c78e557cb6fdb7545ba1897a7fce6.mp4?t=1765957802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Contract Expiration</strong><br> The streaming contract you signed lasts for 10 days. If you can captivate the world with your bottle flipping skills and survive the full 10 days, freedom might be waiting for you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761310/extras/a21110edadec5bf7d2bd8d9cc215f40d.poster.avif?t=1765957802\" width=1100 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761310/extras/a21110edadec5bf7d2bd8d9cc215f40d.webm?t=1765957802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761310/extras/a21110edadec5bf7d2bd8d9cc215f40d.mp4?t=1765957802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight Alongside and Compete with Comrades</strong> <br> Up to 4 players can join the online competitive multiplayer. Will you cooperate with your comrades to make your stream a sensation, or will you compete to steal the viewers' hearts as rivals? The dynamic among your comrades is a crucial element of this game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Diverse Cast of Bottles</strong> <br>Purchase a variety of bottles from the online shop, &quot;Haven Market.&quot; Each bottle has unique characteristics. Master their different traits to achieve the perfect flip.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story and Mystery</strong> <br>As you endlessly flip alone, you receive cryptic messages from your viewers every morning. What is the truth behind this peculiar island, and what is your fate? As you continue your stream, the world's distortions and the reasons behind them will gradually become clear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Controls and Deep Strategy</strong> <br>The simple mouse controls make bottle flipping easy for anyone. However, your skills and choice of bottles will be put to the test if you want to increase your success rate and earn efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of this all-or-nothing bottle flip challenge, does success await you, or will you fade away? <br>Take your seat and face the flip!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Online multiplayer requires a connection to the Steam network. Connectivity may vary depending on network traffic and server status.<br>*Multiplayer performance depends on the host's system. We recommend the player with the highest specs host the game.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"King of the Flip","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3761310/74e3fa2138b9310315f27f2450e8e20a4913047b.jpg"},{"name":"The Star of Hope","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3761310/1ed15f899d15daf60c2022d9238d628746d4cd15.jpg"},{"name":"First broadcast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3761310/a332892e87690a3f0a43eb3a961ccaa781efaa04.jpg"},{"name":"Footsteps of Dawn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3761310/fedeac71abc4d9c4b06b8f4dea4a7774c5afbbff.jpg"},{"name":"Island Acclimation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3761310/82de33ae949fb7d89328bbd16f1612a5260718c9.jpg"},{"name":"Door to Freedom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3761310/756861e1e4fcc2c90184c893d9bbf1d1387d0b9e.jpg"},{"name":"World Completer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3761310/a34508d3760192fff9be1b76981971a3f9a844af.jpg"},{"name":"Descent into Darkness","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3761310/eb7fc5d495d91079c1b03c962444c0f3ee3f77ba.jpg"},{"name":"The Newcomer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3761310/b0c0c667b833b1f426a49f0193b8d02c31dba31f.jpg"},{"name"